# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is public. Anything matching the patterns below would be
# published irreversibly the moment it were committed — a leaked seed phrase
# cannot be un-leaked by deleting the file afterwards, because the commit
# stays in history and in every clone.
#
# Deliberately broad. A pattern that occasionally ignores something harmless
# costs nothing; one that misses a key costs everything.
*.wallet
*.wallet.json
wallet.json
wallet-*.json
*seed*.txt
*seed-phrase*
*mnemonic*
*.key
*.pem
identity
identity-*
**/identity
keystore/
secrets/
data/
chain/data/
*-export.txt
*-export.json
DECKXCOIN-WALLET-*
